  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_bone/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"594\" height=\"153\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>骨骼</strong>家具套裝，適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>奇幻家具</strong></a>，新增功能完整的傢俱，包括但不限於：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p>\n<p>此套裝提供兩種變體：<strong>骷髏</strong>與<strong>凋靈</strong>，兩者皆包含相同的傢俱方塊。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要製作<strong>骨磚</strong>，必須放入<strong>#minecraft:stone_crafting_materials</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_bone/stonecutter_bricks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要製作<strong>骨骼</strong>傢俱方塊，必須將<strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>骨磚</strong>與<strong>靈魂沙</strong>放入<strong>家具工作台</strong>中。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_bone/skeleton_furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_bone/wither_furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
